       creation can send an optional hand-drawn image-space prompt to the
       worker, remnants use known dimensions plus material catalog selection or
       creation, and review renders the stored photo under geometry. Operators
       can delete outer vertices, correct a two-vertex dimension by scaling the
       full polygon, and save the result as an active manual revision.

