       scoring and are treated as hard outer-boundary constraints. Facade
       quadrilateral prompts and rectangular automatic facade detections are
       rectified with homography metadata, and the photo overlay projects
       rectified millimeter geometry back onto the original source photo.

     [2026-06-13] Preserve facade windows during rectification
     Files changed: workers/geometry-capture/main.py
     Docs updated: workers/geometry-capture/README.md, TODO.org
     Notes: Facade rectification now carries source detector window polygons
       through the homography instead of relying only on post-warp contour
       detection. Rectified facade openings are de-duplicated and normalized to
       rectangular rings where their contour supports it, while automatic
       facade perspective correction no longer uses loose minimum-area box
       fallback corners.
