     Notes: Sheet-design previews now store explicit semantic layer fallback
       strokes for the sheet boundary and placed cassette contours, preserve
       source layer styles when a standard's pen cannot be resolved, and choose
       a portrait card aspect for tall sheet viewBoxes. Nesting summaries now
       fall back from missing worker metrics to `solution.density` or placed
       source polygon area. Stripped worker responses are enriched from the
       original request before sheet-design persistence, and queue completion
       notifications now use event objects so repeated runs for the same queue
       reload related sheet designs. The dev Mongo previews/summaries/raw
       geometry were regenerated from saved nesting worker results so existing
       runs show the same layer-styled preview and metric contract.

