       and material pile creation/editing/deletion, including inline minimal
       catalog/color creation when the user types material/color names. Material
       pile list filters honor warehouse lineage, returned pile DTOs normalize
       legacy `data.specs` into the standard `specs` block, cached warehouse
       stock counters update on manual pile create/update/delete, and stock
       edits cannot set used sheets above total sheets. Queue warehouse mode
       filters unavailable piles, blocks mixed sheet sizes, persists selected
       stock as `job.materialPool`, and the nesting backend resolves worker
       sheet size/count from that pool while keeping the strict worker payload.
       Generated sheet designs keep material-source context, and marking a
       chosen queue as cut consumes selected pile stock and records
       `data.materialConsumption`.

