    [2026-03-10] Data Model Accuracy Verification Pass
    Files changed:
    - components/shared/status/StatusHistory.vue (add optional entity prop; derive targetId from entity)
    - components/entities/Queue/QueueDetail.vue (add entity-type to StatusHistory)
    - components/entities/CassetteInstance/CassetteInstanceDetail.vue (add entity-type to StatusHistory)
