    - components/entities/Remnant/RemnantDetail.vue (add entity-type; remove non-existent specs.material/color; add TraceLink to pile)
    - components/entities/Project/ProjectDetail.vue (add entity-type to StatusHistory)
    - components/entities/Sheet/SheetDetail.vue (add entity-type to StatusHistory)
    - components/entities/Requisition/RequisitionDetail.vue (fix bogus collection/entityId props on StatusHistory)
    - components/entities/Color/ColorCard.vue (fix color.visuals→color.data.visuals; BaseEntity.toJSON does not hoist data block)
    - components/entities/Organization/OrganizationCard.vue (remove organization.billing.status — not in data model)
