    Notes:
    - Root cause: StatusHistory component did not accept :entity prop despite NEOLIT R9 requiring it.
      Updated to support both old (entityType + targetId) and new (entity + entityType) patterns.
    - Color data not hoisted: Color.toJSON() inherits BaseEntity.toJSON() which keeps data block nested.
      Components must access color.data.visuals.hexCode, not color.visuals.hexCode.
    - Remnant has no material/color fields — those belong to the parent pile. Fixed to TraceLink.
    - Organization toJSON() only exposes name and type — billing is not part of the model.
    - pen-templates/tool-profiles use toDTO() with spread ...data so their fields ARE hoisted.
    - Warehouse uses toJSON() that explicitly hoists address, type, contactPerson — correct.

