  1. Need new status "cut" for batch that was cut already. There can't be "error" or "complete" status for batch (only for runs, see pt3), only "cut" or "draft".
  2. On "complete" need to reset to "draft", just like on "error" status now.
  3. Need to add "runs" for each batch. Run has it's own statuses: "nesting", "error", "complete", "chosen". "Chosen" is human selected, one for each batch, only for runs that are complete. In batch, "cut" status can be toggled only when there is "chosen" run exist.
  4. Runs created automatically on each nesting attempt. Artifacts are associated with runs. Runs can be displayed in batch as tabs or dropdown. Number of runs can be displayed in batch header. Chosen run's artifacts become batch artifacts.
