*** Agent Notes
    [2026-06-05] Formalize Nodi3d operation contract
    Files changed: docs/specs/nodi-operation-contract.md,
      docs/specs/nodi-operation-manifest.schema.json,
      docs/specs/nodi-occs-graph-checklist.md, docs/specs/README.md,
      TODO.org
    Docs updated: docs/specs/nodi-operation-contract.md,
      docs/specs/nodi-operation-manifest.schema.json,
      docs/specs/nodi-occs-graph-checklist.md, docs/specs/README.md
    Notes: Promoted the agreed Nodi3d workflow fixes into a formal
      CutKit-to-Nodi contract: root and edge-attached faces are placement
      modes of one logical shape operation, root faces use a synthetic base
      edge, polygon parents resolve to the same base-edge input, trapezoid
      anchors use `start`/`end`, wrapper graphs keep the same logical
      operation, and face graphs must expose stable edge outputs for recursive
      child placement.

