*** Agent Notes
    [2026-05-26] Dispatch nesting HTTP task executor
    Files changed:
    - server/core/tasks/service.js
    - server/core/tasks/service.spec.js
    - server/plugins/task-executors.js
    - server/runtime/app-registry.js
    - server/features/nesting/operations.js
