    - server/features/nesting/README.md
    - server/runtime/README.md
    - workers/README.md
    - TODO.org
    Notes:
    - Added registered app-side task executor dispatch so `nesting.solve` task runs are claimed by the app and sent to the FastAPI nesting worker instead of remaining queued.
    - The nesting executor now builds worker payloads from polygon parts or dimension fallback rectangles, updates `task_runs` and `nesting_jobs`, and transitions runs out of `NESTING`.
    - Non-retryable executor errors with 4xx status codes now fail task runs directly instead of cycling through `RETRY_WAIT`.
    - Compatibility nesting jobs now store the parent project slug for notification/statistics consumers.
    - Failed or cancelled task runs behind active compatibility jobs are now marked stale so they do not permanently block new queue nesting requests.
    - Nesting statistics now accept the current worker result layout shape as well as the legacy `sheets` shape.

