    Docs updated: packages/domain-cnc/README.md, packages/processes/README.md,
      TODO.org
    Notes: Queue construction now treats job items, material pool, and nesting
      parameters as optional shell-creation inputs. The process compiler now
      lets the domain construction contract own structural input metadata, so
      stale stored action construction/inputPolicy snapshots cannot reintroduce
      required queue item prompts. Recompiled active process definitions after
      the change; the active queue create action now has an empty inputPolicy.

