      `cassette_designs` feature with the full design entity, translate
      generated-screen `primaryStatus` / `primaryStatuses` filters to
      `status.state.primary`, and filter list rows through the same evaluator
      as detail reads. Cassette-like detail previews now use
      `CassetteThumbnail`, preserving the card preview path for baked DXF and
      layer data. Generated action prompt setup failures now surface as screen
      and toast errors instead of silently producing empty controls. The live
      installer `/api/cassette-designs?primaryStatuses=RECEIVED` endpoint was
      verified with a temporary session, which was removed.

