    Notes: `cassetteService.getById()` now passes the full cassette entity to
      `hasLineagePermission()` instead of only `cassette.lineage`, allowing
      process grants scoped by `primaryStatus` to authorize detail reads. The
      live `/api/cassettes/2-GQE6r7` endpoint was reproduced as 403 before the
      fix and verified as 200 after the change with a temporary local session,
      which was then removed.

