      process mutations.
    - Removed standalone Mongo fallback for combined status/entity patches.
      Combined mutations require transactions and fail before partial writes
      when topology cannot provide them.
    - Downgraded sheet-editor snapping documentation to the implemented
      behavior: axis-aligned neighbor bounds, kerf clearance,
