*** [2026-07-15] Repair of remaining review findings

    Corrective implementation scope:
    - Non-status process =updateEntity= no longer disables the action path.
      Process definitions authorize and validate the action, then call the
      owning service's explicit =processUpdate(id, patch, auth)= handler.
      Registered entity services that own repositories/models expose that
      handler through their own feature boundary for allowed canonical block
      paths, so process definitions do not call incompatible generic
      =update()= signatures.
    - Sheet editor snapping now generates magnetic candidates from transformed
      cassette contour edges, filters with transformed polygon clearance, and
      clamps placements/rotations/additions against a usable sheet polygon when
      present. Rectangular bounds remain only the fallback for virtual
      rectangle sheets.
    - The stale validation concern was rechecked on this branch:
      =npm run framework:manifest= and =npm run framework:validate= both pass
      without regenerating or changing =framework.manifest.json=.

