    - =npm run framework:manifest= passed.
    - =npm run framework:validate= passed.
    - =node scripts/check-arch.js= passed with the existing non-blocking
      migration inventory.

*** [2026-07-15] Queue cassette producer visibility and row display repair

    Corrective implementation scope:
    - Generated queue cassette producers were absent when an active process had
      stale compiled user action manifests without =contracts.outputs=.
      Auth hydration now recompiles that active process runtime in memory from
      the semantic process source, so QueueEditor still receives strict current
      action contracts without accepting legacy output shapes in the UI. If the
      semantic source still contains legacy =changeStatus= actions, hydration
      first applies the existing =changeStatus= to =updateEntity= migration in
      memory before compiling; the stored migration scripts remain the durable
      cleanup path.
    - Saved queue item rows now hydrate missing referenced =cassette_design=
      DTOs through the canonical detail endpoint and let =EntityInlineRef=
      fetch when the row does not already have the design object. This fixes
      id-only/unknown cassette rows after reload or list redaction.

    Validation run:
    - =npx vitest run server/features/process-definitions/runtime.spec.js utils/queue-producers.spec.js utils/queue-items.spec.js= passed: 3 files, 9 tests.
    - Vue SFC parse check for =components/QueueEditor.vue= and
      =components/entities/Queue/QueueEntryCard.vue= passed.
    - Follow-up log review found the app was still 500ing on legacy
      =changeStatus= semantic actions during auth hydration. The runtime fix
      was validated with =npx vitest run server/features/process-definitions/runtime.spec.js server/scripts/migrate-process-update-actions.spec.js= and =node scripts/check-arch.js=.
    - Follow-up browser/runtime check exposed that importing
      =server/scripts/migrate-process-update-actions.js= from app runtime made
      Nitro preserve the script's relative =../../packages/processes= import
      as container-absolute =/packages/processes=. Runtime now uses a
      feature-local pure normalizer; the script imports that helper and remains
      the durable persistence path.
    - Queue workspace repair: fixed default machine seeding so =/api/machines=
      no longer attempts a duplicate =machine-system-default= insert when an
      old system record lacks =data.systemKey=. The queue nesting output panel
      now treats runs as current output/revision state: accepted queue output
      run first, latest readable run otherwise, with no all-runs selector in
      the production workspace.
    - Validation: =npx vitest run server/features/machines/repository.spec.js server/features/machines/machines.spec.js utils/queue-runs.spec.js utils/queue-items.spec.js utils/queue-producers.spec.js= passed; =node scripts/check-arch.js= passed.
    - Queue producer/row repair: generated queue cassette producer actions now
      come from the current queue-detail screen action ids and are accepted
      only when their compiled =contracts.outputs= includes
      =cassette_design=. Saved queue rows render the related cassette design
      through compact inline refs instead of embedding a full cassette-design
      card in the row header.
    - Validation: =npx vitest run utils/queue-producers.spec.js utils/queue-items.spec.js utils/queue-runs.spec.js components/generated/action-visibility.spec.js= passed; Vue SFC parse check for =QueueEditor.vue=, =QueueEntryCard.vue=, and =GeneratedEntityDetail.vue= passed.
