   [[file:components/process-designer/TODO.org][components/process-designer/TODO.org]].
   Earlier implementation notes were removed from this summary because they
   described intermediate contracts that no longer match the current palette.
* WAITING Template entity as actual template for generate typed artifacts with.
  :PROPERTIES:
  :ARCHIVE_TIME: 2026-08-06 Thu 09:46
  :ARCHIVE_FILE: /home/isuo/Projects/cutkit-demo/TODO.org
  :ARCHIVE_CATEGORY: TODO
